And you have that great line that you said to John.
你对约翰说的那句台词太棒了。

987
00:56:48.550 --> 00:56:50.610
And he was like, I said, what was that like?
他说，我问他，当时是什么感觉？

988
00:56:50.670 --> 00:56:55.650
He said, oh, Ange, it was so much fun to see John lose it like that.
他说，哦，安吉，看到约翰那样笑真是太有趣了。

989
00:56:55.770 --> 00:56:57.850
He said he lost it.
他说他彻底失控了。

990
00:56:58.330 --> 00:57:04.750
There are a couple of times on the show where John has laughed so hard that like you can't,
剧里有几次约翰笑得太厉害，以至于你根本，

991
00:57:04.750 --> 00:57:10.690
you just can't even film him because when he really loses it, he cannot be brought back.
你甚至没法拍他，因为当他真的失控时，他就回不来了。

992
00:57:10.850 --> 00:57:11.530
He can't.
他真的回不来。

993
00:57:11.810 --> 00:57:13.610
He's like he is what we said.
他就像我们说的那样。

994
00:57:13.730 --> 00:57:14.310
He is destroyed.
他彻底崩溃了。

995
00:57:14.510 --> 00:57:14.930
He's destroyed.
他彻底崩溃了。

996
00:57:15.050 --> 00:57:15.810
He doubles over.
他笑得直不起腰。

997
00:57:16.030 --> 00:57:16.990
He kind of tears up.
他甚至笑出了眼泪。

998
00:57:17.070 --> 00:57:18.070
He can't make noise.
他连声音都发不出来。

999
00:57:18.530 --> 00:57:20.710
It was laughing like that.
就是那样大笑。

1000
00:57:20.850 --> 00:57:24.490
And I said, Creed, I mean, how did you how many takes did you do?
我说，克里德，我是说，你们拍了多少条？

1001
00:57:24.590 --> 00:57:27.130
And he said, I think we got one where he kept it together.
他说，我想我们有一条他表现得还不错的。

1002
00:57:27.330 --> 00:57:28.850
