1199
01:06:21.860 --> 01:06:27.480
Played by Yvette Nicole Brown, who would later go to star in Community.
由伊薇特·尼科尔·布朗（Yvette Nicole Brown）饰演，她后来主演了《废柴联盟》（Community）。

