01:06:38.240 --> 01:06:40.540
Her, like, you know what it is?
她，怎么说呢，你知道是怎么回事吗？

1204
01:06:40.660 --> 01:06:46.360
I feel like we're getting this opportunity to have someone outside of the Dunder Mifflin
我觉得我们难得有机会让邓德·米夫林公司以外的人

